**Final takeaway:** for an embodied Siri replacement, the best-value device is not necessarily the one with the strongest CPU. It is the one with **expressive actuators, a reliable control protocol, predictable sensors, low latency and repairable hardware**. An inexpensive toy attached to a good local voice engine can be more effective than an impressive but locked-down 'AI robot'.

